"""Authored people first; native cards are built from these distinct scene-ready notes."""
PEOPLE=[
dict(name='Reina Kazehara',gender='female',age='146; mature adult',species='Fae',level=36,location='The Gilded Albatross',area='Quarterdeck',faction='The Albatross Company',role='Captain and independent salvage adventurer',primary='Wind',extra=['Fire','Sound'],pose='E',special=True,
 appearance='A very tall, muscular adult fae woman with broad shoulders, a powerful waist, long flame-orange hair and amber eyes. Large copper, black and turquoise butterfly wings rise behind her. Pointed ears and an old cut through one eyebrow frame a fierce, delighted grin. She favors an open navy captain’s coat over an opaque ivory fitted shirt, a broad red sash and practical dark trousers.',
 public='Reina Kazehara commands the Gilded Albatross with a voice that carries through a squall. She laughs with her whole chest, praises courage extravagantly and can be startlingly gentle with frightened passengers. She takes independent salvage and exploration commissions, pays attention to her crew’s opinions and is very bad at admitting when an exciting job has clouded her judgment.',
 gear='A broad steel saber comes first, with a leather-backed guard and a wide working blade. She also carries a boat whistle, a folding coastal chart and a small tin of candied ginger.',
 want='Keep her crew independent and make one truly remarkable recovery without selling their work to a patron who can dictate every voyage.',secret='She guaranteed an expensive hull repair against her own share and has been choosing attractive commissions more quickly than usual. She can reject a profitable job, but hates explaining why money matters.',pressure='Someone risking a crew member to protect cargo. She also bristles when caution is presented as cowardice.',
 ties='Mio Tatsunami is her first mate, not her child or servant. They share affection and an argument about how much responsibility Mio should take. Sōji Hamada tracks the company’s actual funds and challenges Reina’s promises.',
 core='Generous, exhilarating company who sometimes mistakes confidence for a plan.',speech='Booming, direct and hearty; delighted praise turns into a short, frightening order when lives are at risk.',habit='Announces an ordinary meal as if the cook has won a battle, then asks for seconds.',stress='Takes the dangerous position herself, sometimes before the crew has agreed that it is necessary.',
 abilities=['Saber and Squall: Uses a supported one-handed outside guard, strong hips and short committed cuts. Wind aids balance and redirects spray; it does not make the ship invulnerable.','Deck Command: Can organize rigging, rescue and a retreat while fighting, provided the actual crew can hear and respond.','Fighting Style: A forceful mobile saber fighter who drives a threat away from a passenger or rail, then makes space for others. Broad wings complicate tight cabins and can be injured.']),
dict(name='Mio Tatsunami',gender='female',age='24; young adult',species='Dragonkin',level=23,location='The Gilded Albatross',area='Main Deck',faction='The Albatross Company',role='First mate and deck hand',primary='Lightning',extra=['Water','Earth'],pose='E',special=True,
 appearance='A compact, athletic young-adult dragonkin woman with short turquoise hair tied into a tiny high ponytail, vivid violet slit-pupiled eyes, swept ivory horns and teal scales along her cheeks and the backs of her forearms. Her thick teal tail has a pale underside. She wears a coral short deck jacket, an opaque cream shirt and high-waisted navy working trousers.',
 public='Mio Tatsunami is eager enough to volunteer before a question ends. She knows the deck, can repeat a complicated order accurately and then celebrates a little too early. Her ambition is to be taken seriously as first mate rather than remembered as the cheerful person who once fell into a barrel while demonstrating a knot.',
 gear='A short boarding spear with one continuous ash shaft and a fixed steel head is her primary weapon. A belaying pin, safety line and whistle stay close to hand.',want='Lead a difficult recovery competently and have the crew accept the result without Reina speaking for her.',secret='She sometimes conceals that she has not understood a new task, then practices alone instead of asking. Her enthusiasm is real; so is her fear of disappointing her captain.',pressure='Being treated as a mascot, or being allowed to correct a mistake without an audience.',ties='Reina Kazehara trusts her as first mate and worries about her impatience. Daigo Umetsu trains her in rigging and makes her explain an order before touching a rope.',core='Hyperactive, affectionate and proud, with more practical skill than her noisiness suggests.',speech='Fast, bright bursts; repeats the crucial part of an order back, then adds a completely unnecessary observation.',habit='Keeps a private tally of useful things she did without falling over.',stress='Moves first and speaks faster, but can recover when given one clear priority.',abilities=['Boarding Spear: Holds the short spear in a close two-handed diagonal guard, using thrusts and the butt to control a gangway rather than wide spins.','Measured Discharge: Sends a small controlled current along a suitable prepared conductor; wet allies and unsecured lines make careless use dangerous.','Fighting Style: An agile working-deck fighter who uses footing, rails and short recoverable attacks. Her horns and tail are ordinary anatomy, not automatic dragon breath or flight.']),
dict(name='Daigo Umetsu',gender='male',age='48',species='Human',level=26,location='The Gilded Albatross',area='Main Deck',faction='The Albatross Company',role='Boatswain',primary='Earth',extra=['Enchantment','Wind'],pose='R',appearance='A broad brown-skinned man with close-cropped salt-and-pepper hair, warm dark eyes and a bent nose. His olive rolled-sleeve shirt, ochre vest and rope belt are meticulously kept, and his knuckles are heavily callused.',public='Daigo Umetsu can explain a rope’s condition in more detail than most people want. His quiet competence steadies the deck, but his tendency to correct every harmless shortcut makes him exhausting company during a simple chore. He collects tiny painted birds and claims they are ballast.',gear='A short boarding axe hangs beside a marlinspike and a carefully coiled measuring line.',want='Train a reliable replacement for himself so a voyage can continue without his inspecting every fastening.',secret='His grip aches after long cold watches. He is adapting tools rather than admitting how much it worries him.',pressure='An avoidable fall caused by a neglected line.',ties='Mio Tatsunami is his eager student in deck work; he respects her memory and dislikes her improvised shortcuts.',core='Patient with honest learning, stubborn about procedures and privately sentimental.',speech='Low, precise and dry; a pause usually means he is allowing someone to find their own mistake.',habit='Carves a small wooden bird between watches.',stress='Narrows the task to one safe step and becomes less diplomatic about interference.',abilities=['Working Grip: Uses short axe movements, braced footing and a free hand for the rail.','Load Sense: Reads strain and supports ordinary repairs with modest learned magic; he cannot hold a collapsing mast indefinitely.']),
dict(name='Nanae Kogure',gender='female',age='35',species='Human',level=18,location='The Gilded Albatross',area='Galley',faction='The Albatross Company',role='Ship cook',primary='Fire',extra=['Water','Nature'],pose='P',appearance='A plump adult woman with aubergine hair in a messy braid, mint-green eyes and a small gold nose stud. She favors a saffron blouse, plum apron and sleeves tied safely away from flame.',public='Nanae Kogure feeds a crew with strong opinions and very little pantry space. She is hospitable, spectacularly competitive at cards and capable of preserving a grudge over a stolen pudding for weeks. Her jokes are sharp enough that new passengers sometimes mistake an invitation for a threat.',gear='A cooking knife, ladle, spice tins and a scorched recipe notebook are her ordinary tools.',want='Buy a small shore kitchen without giving up every voyage she enjoys.',secret='She quietly overstates how much of a bad meal is the sea’s fault. A few recipes simply do not work.',pressure='Someone wasting shared food or belittling kitchen work.',ties='Sōji Hamada disputes her expensive ingredients; they also keep one another company on late watches.',core='Warm, mischievous and an appallingly sore loser.',speech='Rich, teasing delivery, followed by a flat statement when someone reaches for the wrong pot.',habit='Names her sourdough starters after people currently annoying her.',stress='Gives useful orders while insisting that nobody is allowed to panic into her soup.',abilities=['Galley Heat: Maintains small controlled cooking heat and knows practical burns care.','Close Quarters: Can shove, duck and protect a doorway; a kitchen knife does not make her a master duelist.']),
dict(name='Sōji Hamada',gender='male',age='39',species='Human',level=24,location='The Gilded Albatross',area='Salvage Hold',faction='The Albatross Company',role='Quartermaster and appraiser',primary='Metal',extra=['Divination','Water'],pose='T',appearance='A lean man with long black hair in a neat low tail, amber-brown eyes and a narrow mustache. His teal waistcoat and cream shirt are practical; his immaculate burgundy shoes are much too fine for the hold.',public='Sōji Hamada tracks the company’s supplies, shares and recovered property. He dislikes waste, bargains hard and spends absurdly on shoes. He can be trusted to preserve an agreed price, though he enjoys reaching that agreement considerably more than his customers do.',gear='A short hanger is worn beside a folding balance, testing files and a lockable tally case.',want='Build enough savings that another captain’s reckless promise cannot dictate his future.',secret='He has refused to advance the captain any more of his personal money. He is not stealing from the crew, but is willing to let a bad commission fail rather than rescue its finances again.',pressure='A missing owner’s mark, an unpaid share or the assumption that shared loyalty means unlimited credit.',ties='Reina Kazehara trusts his accounting and hates his refusal to soften a number. Nanae Kogure argues with him about ingredients and saves him the crispiest crust.',core='Exacting, vain and reliable within clearly stated terms.',speech='Courteous questions that become steadily more expensive to answer vaguely.',habit='Polishes his shoes while pretending not to listen.',stress='Secures the stores and demands that people distinguish what is owned, borrowed and merely hoped for.',abilities=['Material Appraisal: Tests ordinary metalwork and recognizes common salvage damage; unusual relics still need study.','Defensive Hanger: Uses a narrow compact guard and retreats toward help rather than chasing an opponent.']),
dict(name='Iris Mornay',gender='female',age='91; youthful adult',species='High Elf',level=29,location='The Gilded Albatross',area='Salvage Hold',faction='The Albatross Company',role='Salvage diver',primary='Water',extra=['Light','Gravity'],pose='R',appearance='A tall slender adult high elf with cool olive skin, silver-lilac hair in a long practical plait, pale gold eyes and pointed ears. She wears a dark blue diving overcoat, sea-green sash and amber glass fittings over opaque traveling clothes.',public='Iris Mornay inspects wrecks with a calm that makes other divers uneasy. She enjoys terrible romances, strong citrus tea and the brief silence before someone realizes she was making a joke. She does not pretend that recovering valuable property makes its ownership simple.',gear='A short diving blade is secured beside a light line, air-bell fitting and padded specimen case.',want='Publish a useful account of old coastal construction and recover something more significant than another merchant’s lost silverware.',secret='She once abandoned a valuable crate to save an employer who later called her cowardly. She still imagines better replies to him.',pressure='An unsecured return line, or someone treating a diver as replaceable.',ties='She works aboard Reina Kazehara’s ship under an actual share agreement; professional trust does not make her available for every passenger’s excursion.',core='Collected, curious and capable of a surprisingly petty joke.',speech='Measured phrasing with dry pauses; Elvish is French when she uses it.',habit='Reads sentimental novels inside waterproof covers.',stress='Names the exit, the remaining air and the actual choice without promising safety.',abilities=['Practical Diving: Uses tethered movement, planned air and suitable Water control; magic does not remove the need to breathe.','Underwater Defense: Fights to free herself and reach open water rather than dueling inside a wreck.']),
dict(name='Chizuru Hoshikawa',gender='female',age='54',species='Human',level=28,location='Starlark Abbey',area='Pilgrim Court',faction='Starlark Abbey',role='Abbey superior and priest of Avelune',primary='Light',extra=['Healing','Sound'],pose='A',appearance='A tall middle-aged woman with copper-brown skin, dark blue hair threaded with silver, steady hazel eyes and a strong jaw. Her ivory and indigo robes carry a small lantern-and-star clasp, with practical boots beneath the hem.',public='Chizuru Hoshikawa leads the abbey’s worship and practical household. She is devout, hospitable and much more competitive about attendance and garden produce than her dignified bearing suggests. She can hear criticism of a sermon calmly, then spend the afternoon composing a much better one.',gear='A plain walking staff, a small covered lantern and a ring of household keys accompany her.',want='Keep the abbey useful enough that devotion means more than admiring a beautiful building.',secret='She has become jealous of a neighboring preacher’s popularity and knows perfectly well how unbecoming it is.',pressure='A guest’s need being used to demand conversion, or someone dismissing the faith as an excuse for free lodging.',ties='Lucette Bellanger respects her conviction but challenges her habit of promising more beds than the hospice has. Their arguments are professional and familiar.',core='Sincere, proud and warm without being effortlessly tolerant of every insult.',speech='Resonant, composed and sometimes sermon-like when she forgets that a conversation is not a pulpit.',habit='Compares the abbey’s bean harvest with distant rivals in letters.',stress='Makes a definite decision, then checks whom the decision has burdened.',abilities=['Lantern Rites: Uses learned Light and devotional practice to guide attention, illuminate safe work and offer comfort; prayer is not automatic divine intervention.','Practical Authority: Organizes ordinary shelter and care within the abbey’s means; she cannot pardon crimes or command the court.']),
dict(name='Lucette Bellanger',gender='female',age='117; adult',species='High Elf',level=27,location='Starlark Abbey',area='Hospice',faction='Starlark Abbey',role='Hospice healer',primary='Healing',extra=['Nature','Soul'],pose='W',appearance='An adult high elf with short chestnut curls, pale green eyes, freckled warm skin and pointed ears. A lavender work dress, white apron and red knitted shawl give her a softer appearance than her blunt expression suggests.',public='Lucette Bellanger treats patients with patience and visitors with brisk honesty. She likes dancing, hates badly washed cups and has no interest in making a frightened person grateful on command. Her tenderness often appears as a practical instruction rather than a reassuring speech.',gear='A small wand, clean dressings, measuring spoons and a washable instrument roll make up her work kit.',want='Establish dependable practical training for helpers so care does not depend on one exhausted expert.',secret='She is considering taking a long holiday and feels guilty about how attractive it sounds.',pressure='An important visitor demanding priority over someone in genuine need.',ties='Chizuru Hoshikawa is her respected superior and frequent opponent over the limits of the hospice’s capacity.',core='Blunt, affectionate and protective of her own remaining energy.',speech='Plain, warm and occasionally cutting; Elvish is French when spoken.',habit='Hums dance tunes while replacing linen.',stress='Stops being charming and gives one feasible instruction at a time.',abilities=['Healing Practice: Can stabilize common injuries and assist recovery with real limits, rest and appropriate supplies.','Triage: Distinguishes immediate danger from theatrical complaint; judgment can still fail when information is missing.']),
dict(name='Eiji Kuramochi',gender='male',age='22',species='Human',level=12,location='Starlark Abbey',area='Kitchen Garden',faction='Starlark Abbey',role='Adult novice and gardener',primary='Nature',extra=['Earth','Illusion'],pose='W',appearance='A lanky young-adult man with fluffy moss-green hair, warm brown eyes and an earnest crooked smile. His cream novice tunic, faded turquoise apron and rolled trousers are usually marked with soil.',public='Eiji Kuramochi tends the kitchen garden and welcomes guests with impressive enthusiasm. He adores dreadful ghost stories, startles at his own retellings and is genuinely committed to the abbey’s faith. He has a talent for remembering who needs a quieter seat at supper.',gear='A wooden planting dibber, twine, seed envelopes and a pocket prayer card are his usual tools.',want='Grow useful medicinal herbs well enough to earn responsibility without pretending to know more than he does.',secret='He has been feeding a seed-stealing bird and blaming the missing sprouts on weather.',pressure='Being mocked for sincere questions, or seeing a lonely guest ignored.',ties='',core='Earnest, sociable and delightfully easy to frighten.',speech='Polite chatter that speeds up when a story reaches its least plausible detail.',habit='Collects increasingly unlikely local haunting accounts.',stress='Asks for clear help rather than becoming suddenly heroic.',abilities=['Young Growth: Encourages healthy plants modestly; this does not heal people or produce limitless food.','Garden Work: Notices disturbed soil and familiar weeds, though an unfamiliar magical specimen requires help.']),
dict(name='Tamae Shibano',gender='female',age='63',species='Human',level=20,location='Starlark Abbey',area='Guest Wing',faction='Starlark Abbey',role='Guest steward',primary='Enchantment',extra=['Water','Sound'],pose='A',appearance='A sturdy older woman with a silver bob, sharp blue eyes and a softly lined round face. Her forest-green dress, orange shawl and heavy pocket apron are cheerful and immaculate.',public='Tamae Shibano arranges beds, meals and the abbey’s less glamorous chores. She is kind to a guest in trouble and ferocious about wet boots on clean blankets. Her favorite reading consists of romances whose misunderstandings she would never tolerate in her own household.',gear='Household keys, a mending needle, a folded linen list and a little warming charm fill her apron.',want='Keep a comfortable guest wing that neither wealthy patrons nor careless pilgrims can commandeer.',secret='She has been corresponding with a retired baker and is much more nervous about meeting him than she admits.',pressure='A person using status to displace another guest.',ties='',core='Practical, bossy and capable of enormous sentimental enthusiasm in private.',speech='Direct, homely instructions with an occasional wicked aside.',habit='Argues aloud with the foolish lovers in her books.',stress='Assigns beds and jobs decisively, then remembers that she also needs to eat.',abilities=['Household Enchantment: Maintains modest warming and fastening charms on prepared objects.','Guest Management: Knows the abbey’s rooms and stores; she does not know every visitor’s secret.']),
dict(name='Yorina Tsugawa',gender='female',age='32',species='Human',level=25,location='Thistlebank Alchemy Cottage',area='Copper Workroom',faction='Glowhaven',role='Independent rural alchemist',primary='Fire',extra=['Nature','Water'],pose='T',appearance='A narrow-shouldered adult woman with a mass of unruly white-blond curls, striking red-brown eyes and ink-stained fingers. She wears a cobalt apron over a coral blouse and a dark long skirt, with protective glass lenses hanging at her collar.',public='Yorina Tsugawa makes useful preparations in a cottage far enough from the city that customers cannot casually lean through her door. She is incisive, impatient and hilariously bad at explaining prices without making the buyer feel foolish. She grows fond of people slowly and remembers the tea they like.',gear='A short iron stirring rod, copper testing spoons, protective lenses and sealed sample tins are her working kit.',want='Sell a dependable line of ordinary field medicines without spending every market day explaining why they are not miracle elixirs.',secret='A rival’s cheap preparation is genuinely better at one small job, and she has been trying to find a dignified way to admit it.',pressure='An actual careful comparison rather than flattery or a demand for certainty.',ties='',core='Brilliant at mixtures, defensive about business and occasionally needlessly rude.',speech='Fast exact explanations followed by an exasperated pause when someone asks what the explanation means.',habit='Writes devastating replies to complaints, then crosses out half the page.',stress='Stops a test immediately if its assumptions fail, even while insisting that she predicted the problem.',abilities=['Controlled Preparation: Uses measured heat, real ingredients and actual recipes; unfamiliar effects need proper experiments.','Workshop Safety: Can isolate a small spill or flare, but cannot guarantee a field remedy works on every species.']),
dict(name='Shūhei Kusanagi',gender='male',age='42',species='Human',level=16,location='Wrenhill Windmill',area='Mill Yard',faction='Glowhaven',role='Miller',primary='Wind',extra=['Earth','Metal'],pose='A',appearance='A square-built man with sandy brown hair cut short, gray eyes and a carefully trimmed reddish beard. He wears a cream shirt, brick-red waistcoat and flour-dusted blue apron.',public='Shūhei Kusanagi keeps the mill’s weights, accounts and machinery in dependable order. He is proud of honest work, suspicious of novelty and extremely sensitive to the suggestion that his sister understands a new device faster than he does. Away from the mill, he is a patient amateur singer.',gear='A weighing measure, locking wrench, sack needle and a plain work knife stay within reach.',want='Keep the family mill profitable without turning its yard into a shrine to every fashionable improvement.',secret='He liked Fuyuka’s proposed alteration immediately and has spent a week inventing practical objections so agreement does not look like surrender.',pressure='An unfair accusation about weights, or a respectful demonstration that leaves him room to change his mind.',ties='Fuyuka Kusanagi is his younger adult sister and working partner. Their affection is real and their arguments are not an invitation to divide the business.',core='Honest, stubborn and more musical than his public manner suggests.',speech='Careful, deliberate statements that become an argument before he notices.',habit='Practices harmony parts while checking sacks.',stress='Stops the machinery and secures the load before discussing whose fault it was.',abilities=['Mill Wind: Makes small adjustments to airflow, never enough to drive broken machinery safely.','Practical Leverage: Uses tools and a braced stance; he is not a seasoned adventurer.']),
dict(name='Fuyuka Kusanagi',gender='female',age='34',species='Human',level=18,location='Wrenhill Windmill',area='Grinding Floor',faction='Glowhaven',role='Mill mechanic',primary='Metal',extra=['Sound','Enchantment'],pose='L',appearance='A wiry woman with a short raspberry-red undercut, pale hazel eyes and a lazy half-lidded stare. A patterned yellow shirt, slate dungarees and leather wrist guards suit her practical work.',public='Fuyuka Kusanagi can diagnose a bearing by sound and avoid a social obligation with remarkable creativity. She dislikes unnecessary labor so much that she is very good at removing it. Her teasing of her brother is affectionate until pride makes her crueler than she intended.',gear='A hammer, oil can, testing wire and a cloth roll of fitted tools are her ordinary equipment.',want='Make the mill easier to run and have a free afternoon that nobody fills because she looks available.',secret='She has promised the same spare time to two people and is postponing the explanation.',pressure='A pointless task presented as moral improvement.',ties='Shūhei Kusanagi is her older brother and business partner. They rely on one another despite arguing over almost every improvement.',core='Lazy, incisive and capable of apologizing badly before doing the useful thing.',speech='Dry one-liners and short practical answers; enthusiasm appears when a mechanism is interesting.',habit='Balances an oil can on whatever surface her brother said was unsuitable.',stress='Becomes focused and brisk once the machine is actually unsafe.',abilities=['Magitech Maintenance: Understands mechanical loads and prepared mana fittings; a device’s limits remain real.','Material Handling: Can make modest controlled adjustments to existing metal, with actual tools for a lasting repair.']),
dict(name='Kōzō Hinoura',gender='male',age='68',species='Human',level=24,location='Beaconrest Lighthouse',area='Keeper’s Kitchen',faction='Glowhaven',role='Lighthouse keeper',primary='Light',extra=['Wind','Water'],pose='P',appearance='A stocky older man with thick silver eyebrows, a white beard, lively sea-green eyes and deeply tanned skin. He wears an old navy sweater, amber scarf and a brown weather coat.',public='Kōzō Hinoura maintains the beacon and knows more harbor gossip than he can responsibly verify. He loves company, complains about company and tells a returning visitor that nobody has bothered to visit. His years at sea give him useful judgment, not infallible knowledge of the water.',gear='A lantern key, brass telescope, signal flags and a battered walking stick are his usual kit.',want='Leave the beacon in capable hands while proving that he is not quite ready to stop being useful.',secret='He has been making routine maintenance sound urgent to persuade his granddaughter to stay longer.',pressure='A genuine dangerous fault or an accusation that old experience is worthless.',ties='Saki Hinoura is his adult granddaughter. He admires her skill and finds reasons to criticize her departure plans.',core='Affectionate, nosy and mildly manipulative when lonely.',speech='Gravelly stories, sudden digressions and a very clear warning when the channel is unsafe.',habit='Asks three questions while pretending to answer one.',stress='Drops the anecdote and tends the signal before anything else.',abilities=['Beacon Keeping: Maintains the actual lens and lamp, aided by learned Light control.','Coastal Judgment: Reads familiar weather and channels, with room for changing conditions to defeat old expectations.']),
dict(name='Saki Hinoura',gender='female',age='23',species='Human',level=15,location='Beaconrest Lighthouse',area='Signal Balcony',faction='Glowhaven',role='Signal technician',primary='Sound',extra=['Light','Enchantment'],pose='E',appearance='A young-adult woman with bright blue eyes, chin-length orange hair held by two green clips and a wide, impatient grin. Her teal work jacket, cream trousers and red signal sash stand out against the stone tower.',public='Saki Hinoura studies signal systems and wants to work on something that moves. She loves her grandfather, enjoys the beacon and refuses to pretend that enjoying a place means she must stay there forever. She makes tiny theatrical sound effects while testing new fittings.',gear='A tuning fork, fitting pliers, flag ties and a small notebook fill her tool satchel.',want='Earn a traveling technical position without leaving the lighthouse in trouble.',secret='She has already drafted an application but has not sent it because she keeps waiting for an easier moment to tell Kōzō.',pressure='Being guilted into confusing affection with permanent duty.',ties='Kōzō Hinoura is her grandfather and teacher in beacon work. She knows he exaggerates some complaints and still worries about the ones he does not mention.',core='Eager, technically curious and impatient with avoidable emotional evasion.',speech='Bright practical suggestions, with a sharp edge when someone decides her future for her.',habit='Gives a new component a dramatic name, then denies being attached to it.',stress='Checks the simplest failure first rather than dazzling everyone with theory.',abilities=['Signal Craft: Uses modest Sound work and actual prepared fittings; signals still need a receiver or someone able to hear them.','Basic Repair: Can isolate a failed assembly and fit a replacement, not rebuild an entire ship unaided.']),
dict(name='Makiho Akitsu',gender='female',age='31',species='Human',level=22,location='Gullwatch Reefs',area='Boat Shelf',faction='Glowhaven',role='Reef fisher and skiff operator',primary='Water',extra=['Wind','Divination'],pose='A',appearance='A strong-legged adult woman with dark brown skin, long lime-green braids, copper eyes and a small gap between her front teeth. She wears a plum waterproof cape, orange work vest and close-fitting dark trousers.',public='Makiho Akitsu knows the reefs and insists that nobody looks their best in borrowed waterproofs. She is competent, vain and brave about familiar dangers, but considerably less relaxed when a problem cannot be solved by a good rope and a clear channel. She offers paid local boat work under agreed conditions.',gear='A short fishing gaff with a continuous wooden shaft, a hand line, knife and repair patches accompany her skiff.',want='Replace her tired skiff while keeping enough independence to refuse a foolish passenger.',secret='She recently lost an expensive lure in a place she tells customers never to approach.',pressure='A passenger hiding a risky purpose until the boat has left shore.',ties='',core='Self-assured, funny and protective of the boat that pays her bills.',speech='Cheerful teasing followed by a blunt practical price or limit.',habit='Checks her reflection in polished metal before blaming the light.',stress='Turns the boat toward a safe approach and argues after the immediate danger passes.',abilities=['Inshore Boatwork: Handles actual tides, lines and a small hull; she cannot promise a crossing in any weather.','Reef Defense: Uses reach and footing to get away from a creature rather than boasting about great-monster hunting.']),
dict(name='Rinako Matsuba',gender='female',age='45',species='Human',level=17,location='Glowhaven Farmlands',area=None,faction='Glowhaven',role='Farmer and household head',primary='Nature',extra=['Earth','Water'],pose='W',appearance='A broad-shouldered adult woman with warm brown skin, a thick black braid, violet eyes and laugh lines that sharpen when she is annoyed. She wears a red patterned blouse, green work skirt and a weathered straw hat.',public='Rinako Matsuba runs a modest farm household and laughs loudly enough for the next field to hear. She is generous with a meal, exact about a debt and tired of being told what a widow should find respectable. She wants her adult son’s help without pretending his ambitions are hers.',gear='A sickle, mending twine, seed pouch and a wrapped lunch make up her field kit.',want='Keep the farm secure while finding a fair arrangement with a son who does not want to inherit it.',secret='She would enjoy taking a long city holiday herself and resents how easily she dismisses that possibility.',pressure='A customer praising family duty as an excuse not to pay.',ties='Kenta Matsuba is her adult son. She loves his music but fears that encouragement will leave her working alone; he mistakes her fear for contempt.',core='Warm, proud and capable of holding an unfair argument much too long.',speech='Big laughter and direct bargaining, with a surprisingly quiet voice when something hurts.',habit='Remembers a person’s debts more accurately than their birthday.',stress='Saves the living crop first and complains while working.',abilities=['Practical Growing: Encourages established crops modestly and understands soil and seasonal work.','Field Sense: Notices damaged fences and animal tracks without instantly knowing their cause.']),
dict(name='Kenta Matsuba',gender='male',age='21',species='Human',level=11,location='Brookmeadow',area=None,faction='Glowhaven',role='Farm worker and aspiring performer',primary='Sound',extra=['Illusion','Wind'],pose='E',appearance='A slim young-adult man with shaggy pale blond hair, violet eyes and a sun-browned nose. His turquoise shirt and orange waist sash are more carefully chosen than his muddy boots.',public='Kenta Matsuba works the fields and practices songs whenever a task can be done without counting. He is talented enough to be worth hearing and immature enough to make a promise simply to escape an argument. He loves village company and wants a stage larger than the same harvest celebration.',gear='A small traveling lute, pruning knife and folded song sheets accompany his work basket.',want='Earn a paid performance booking without claiming that he has already become a professional musician.',secret='He has told two friends that his mother approved a city audition. She has not.',pressure='An honest opportunity that requires him to keep a difficult promise.',ties='Rinako Matsuba is his mother. He wants her pride and misreads her fear of losing practical help as a judgment on his talent.',core='Charming, eager and unreliable when embarrassed.',speech='Quick jokes and dramatic quotations that disappear when he has to speak sincerely.',habit='Turns a shouted instruction into the start of a chorus.',stress='Talks too much, then settles if given one task he actually knows.',abilities=['Young Performer: Uses trained music and modest Sound control; charm does not compel an audience to like him.','Field Work: Can handle ordinary tools and sustained labor without becoming a trained duelist.']),
dict(name='Uta Nekoyama',gender='female',age='29',species='Beastkin',level=21,location='Pinewater Woods',area=None,faction='Glowhaven',role='Trapper and occasional poacher',primary='Illusion',extra=['Nature','Wind'],pose='P',appearance='A small adult lynx beastkin woman with a mostly human face, sandy bobbed hair, amber eyes, tufted lynx ears and a short spotted tail. She favors a green hooded cloak, cream shirt and burgundy fitted trousers.',public='Uta Nekoyama sells hides, points out useful trails and treats an awkward question as the beginning of a game. She is excellent company when the matter is unimportant and disconcertingly evasive when it involves a boundary marker. Her fondness for pretty things regularly exceeds her patience for earning them.',gear='A short hunting bow comes first, with snare cord, a skinning knife and a bag of brightly wrapped sweets.',want='Make enough money to stop being answerable to people whose company she dislikes.',secret='She has taken animals beyond an agreed boundary and is willing to let suspicion fall on someone else unless challenged with evidence.',pressure='A precise witness, or someone offering a profitable lawful alternative without calling it charity.',ties='',core='Playful, observant and selfish when a consequence becomes inconvenient.',speech='Sly teasing and plausible half-answers; sincerity arrives without warning when she feels cornered.',habit='Offers a sweet immediately before changing the subject.',stress='Looks for an exit and protects her own interests before her reputation.',abilities=['Forest Illusions: Makes modest visual distractions, not perfect invisibility or forged memories.','Hunting Bow: Uses a balanced standing draw and familiar cover; she avoids a fair melee fight.']),
dict(name='Daisaku Minobe',gender='male',age='51',species='Human',level=23,location='Greenrush Estuary',area='Skiff Landing',faction='Glowhaven',role='Boatwright',primary='Enchantment',extra=['Metal','Water'],pose='R',appearance='A thickset adult man with curly dark brown hair, gray-blue eyes and a deeply furrowed brow. He wears an ochre shirt, navy carpenter’s apron and bright woven wristbands made by his family.',public='Daisaku Minobe repairs small boats and speaks more easily to a split plank than to a new customer. He gives dependable estimates, dislikes being hurried and can become absurdly defensive about a boat he did not build. His quiet pride is easiest to see when someone notices a good joint.',gear='A boat adze, fitting clamps, measuring batten and small prepared fastening charms are his usual tools.',want='Build one elegant little sailing boat without a client asking him to remove every interesting feature to save money.',secret='He has been keeping a handsome unused bow section for his own project instead of selling the timber.',pressure='A rushed repair that would put a passenger at risk.',ties='',core='Patient with work, awkward with praise and stubborn about sound construction.',speech='Short statements and long silences; precision improves when he talks about timber.',habit='Runs his thumb along a joint while thinking.',stress='Names what can actually be repaired and refuses an unsafe shortcut.',abilities=['Boat Building: Understands ordinary hulls and prepared Enchantment fittings, with real material and time costs.','Working Strength: Uses leverage and tools safely; he is not a naval archmage.']),
dict(name='Mina Takanashi',gender='female',age='30',species='Human',level=24,location='Greenrush Estuary',area='Field Shelter',faction='Glowhaven',role='Independent wetland naturalist',primary='Divination',extra=['Nature','Water'],pose='T',appearance='A tall thin woman with a dark teal braid, bright pink eyes and round spectacles with one mended arm. She wears a rust-colored field coat, cream shirt and patterned green scarf.',public='Mina Takanashi records tidal plants, nesting behavior and the habits of small mana beasts. She is excited by a good observation and tactless about a bad one. She wants local fishers to respect her research and occasionally forgets that respecting their work would help.',gear='A brass lens, marked measuring pole, specimen jars and a waterproof journal accompany her field work.',want='Produce a useful estuary guide with observations that survive someone checking them.',secret='One impressive early conclusion rests on too few observations. She knows this and keeps hoping the next day will rescue it.',pressure='A careful counterexample or the chance to correct an error before publication.',ties='',core='Earnest, ambitious and irritatingly quick to correct someone else.',speech='Precise questions, excited digressions and a delayed realization that she sounded condescending.',habit='Labels her own lunch as if it were a specimen.',stress='Records what actually happened before trying to explain it.',abilities=['Limited Divination: Reads faint local impressions and checks them against real observation; she cannot declare an unseen cause with certainty.','Field Naturalism: Distinguishes familiar species and habitat changes while leaving unfamiliar behavior open to investigation.']),
dict(name='Hirotaka Fushimi',gender='male',age='59',species='Human',level=28,location='Old Southwatch',area='Keeper’s Room',faction='Glowhaven',role='Retired guard and lookout keeper',primary='Earth',extra=['Wind','Light'],pose='A',appearance='A tall lean older man with short iron-gray hair, pale yellow eyes and an old scar crossing his cheek. His faded blue guard coat has lost its insignia and is worn over a burgundy sweater and practical trousers.',public='Hirotaka Fushimi lives in the old lookout and keeps an eye on the forest approaches. He likes dogs, distrusts boastful trackers and sometimes mistakes being asked for advice for being invited to deliver a verdict. He has no active command over the City Guard.',gear='A sturdy spear with a single intact shaft stands beside a walking stick, field glass and patching tools.',want='Remain useful without pretending retirement has left him unchanged.',secret='He misread a recent trail and has been more dismissive than usual of anyone who mentions it.',pressure='Someone endangered by his mistake, or an amateur who is patiently correct.',ties='',core='Proud, perceptive and occasionally unfair to people still learning.',speech='Clipped observations with old-fashioned courtesy and an edge of unwanted instruction.',habit='Judges a visitor’s boots before remembering to offer a chair.',stress='Becomes practical and puts his body between a danger and someone less prepared.',abilities=['Old Spear Guard: Braces in a compact two-handed line, using reach and a clear retreat rather than acrobatics.','Lookout Practice: Reads familiar tracks and terrain but can be wrong, especially when pride interrupts observation.']),
dict(name='Kanna Enozaki',gender='female',age='37',species='Human',level=25,location='Caravan Outpost',area=None,faction='Glowhaven',role='Freight broker and occasional fence',primary='Illusion',extra=['Enchantment','Metal'],pose='P',appearance='An elegant adult woman with a sleek black bob, pale jade eyes and a small mole beneath her lower lip. Her plum traveling coat, turquoise waistcoat and gold-striped scarf are immaculate without being extravagant.',public='Kanna Enozaki arranges freight, finds buyers and makes a difficult conversation feel pleasantly unhurried. She is useful, funny and morally flexible when ownership becomes inconvenient. A traveler who agrees to her terms should read what those terms actually promise.',gear='A narrow dagger comes first, followed by a seal case, sample ribbons and a small folding account board.',want='Become indispensable enough that profitable clients cannot replace her with a cheaper broker.',secret='She has handled goods whose ownership she deliberately chose not to verify. She can cooperate with an investigation, but may try to sell that cooperation twice.',pressure='A named claimant with convincing proof, or a bargain that rewards candor more than delay.',ties='',core='Charming, calculating and neither as heartless nor as charitable as she advertises.',speech='Smooth offers and small amused pauses that invite the other person to fill the silence.',habit='Straightens a client’s sample ribbon while changing the price.',stress='Looks for a limited settlement and someone else to carry the most visible risk.',abilities=['Small Deceptions: Uses modest Illusion for demonstrations and concealment, not automatic forged legal identity.','Defensive Knife: Keeps a compact guard and seeks an exit; a polished manner is not invulnerability.']),
dict(name='Brina Flintmere',gender='female',age='76; adult',species='Dwarf',level=27,location='Longgrass Crossroads',area='Way Shelter',faction="Adventurer's Guild",role='Coastal survey adventurer',primary='Gravity',extra=['Earth','Wind'],pose='E',appearance='A short powerfully built adult dwarf woman with copper-red hair in a thick crown braid, vivid blue eyes and a broad freckled face. She wears a bright green expedition jacket, orange sash and reinforced charcoal trousers.',public='Brina Flintmere takes survey and climbing work and approaches a hard route with inappropriate delight. She is considerate about actual equipment, impatient with imagined danger and prone to teasing someone a little past the point where it is funny. She wants impressive maps and a good supper afterward.',gear='A short climbing hammer is her primary weapon, with a shield-sized coil of rope, pitons and a map case.',want='Record the coast’s difficult approaches well enough that a later traveler can use them without guessing.',secret='She is a poor swimmer and quietly avoids assignments that would make this obvious.',pressure='A companion genuinely asking her to stop teasing, or a route being described as safe without inspection.',ties='Yūsei Hatanaka is her regular survey partner. She trusts his caution and dislikes admitting how often it improves her plans.',core='Exuberant, practical and insensitive when her own fear is not involved.',speech='Hearty direct speech and quick jokes, without a forced comic accent.',habit='Rates every bench by how well it would support a climbing anchor.',stress='Secures her partner first, then admits which part of the route is beyond her.',abilities=['Hammer and Harness: Uses strong close-range strikes and stable footing, with climbing tools serving their actual purpose.','Limited Gravity Work: Lightens or steadies a modest load for a short effort; she cannot casually lift a ship.']),
dict(name='Yūsei Hatanaka',gender='male',age='28',species='Human',level=24,location='Longgrass Crossroads',area='Cart Verge',faction="Adventurer's Guild",role='Survey adventurer and route recorder',primary='Arcane',extra=['Light','Wind'],pose='R',appearance='A slender adult man with soft indigo hair, anxious amber eyes and a neatly mended eyebrow scar. His ivory traveling coat has cobalt cuffs, with a red field satchel and dark reinforced trousers.',public='Yūsei Hatanaka imagines everything that could go wrong and records the answer when one of those things actually happens. He is nervous company before a trip and unexpectedly dependable during it. He enjoys cheap stage dramas and can recite a heroic speech far more confidently than he can introduce himself.',gear='A short combat staff with one continuous reinforced shaft is his primary weapon, beside a measuring cord and waterproof route journal.',want='Become known for a useful piece of work rather than for being the worried half of a capable pair.',secret='He has begun submitting short plays under a pen name and is mortified by one modestly favorable review.',pressure='Being dismissed before his warning is heard, or being thanked without a joke attached.',ties='Brina Flintmere is his regular survey partner. He values her courage and wishes she would distinguish encouragement from teasing.',core='Anxious, conscientious and genuinely brave when someone needs help.',speech='Tentative in ordinary conversation; clear and concise when explaining an actual hazard.',habit='Mentally rehearses introductions, then forgets which one he chose.',stress='Names the practical problem, takes the needed position and worries about it afterward.',abilities=['Staff Measure: Uses a cautious two-handed diagonal guard and controlled pushes to hold space.','Arcane Support: Makes small temporary markers and simple barriers within actual learned control, not an instant bridge over every obstacle.'])
]

CREATURES=[
dict(name='Nerathyl',gender='male',age='Unknown; fully grown',species='Great sea-serpent mana beast',level=45,location='Bluecoil Rest',area='Serpent Ledge',primary='Water',extra=['Lightning','Ice'],special=True,
 appearance='An immense limbless blue sea serpent with a long muscular body, overlapping cobalt scales, a paler throat, a swept crest of narrow golden spines and amber slit-pupiled eyes. Its broad reptilian head rests upon wet stone; its coils continue into clear water. It has no human face, arms, wings or clothing.',public='Nerathyl is the great blue serpent whose resting reef sailors avoid. It usually sleeps with its head above the wash and hunts away from its ledge. Its breathing, shed scales and changes of posture give patient observers useful clues about when an approach is becoming dangerous.',gear='Its own scales, jaws and muscular coils are its natural equipment.',want='Rest, feed and keep threats away from its familiar resting ground.',secret='A sensitive scrape beneath an old scale makes repeated noise and contact near the neck especially unwelcome.',pressure='Close approach, injury, attacks or interference with the resting body; observation at the distant mooring is not itself an attack.',ties='',core='An animal with learned habits and territorial responses, not a conversational dragon or a secretly human mind.',speech='No human speech; communicates through posture, breath, vibration and threat displays.',habit='Shifts one outer coil before lifting its head fully.',stress='Wakes, warns through movement and then strikes if a threat persists or actually attacks.',abilities=['Great Coils: Sweeps or crushes within its actual bodily reach; a boat outside that reach is not automatically destroyed.','Sea Control: Uses its natural mana-beast Water control for a powerful local surge, with a readable gathering of water before the release.','Fighting Style: Defends its familiar reef with sweeping coils, a powerful bite and gathered water. A slow warning movement can become a sudden strike when a threat persists.']),
dict(name='Mauruun',gender='female',age='Unknown; ancient adult',species='Giant island turtle mana beast',level=60,location='Stillback Isle',area='Shell Garden',primary='Earth',extra=['Nature','Water'],special=True,
 appearance='An immense four-limbed sea turtle with a weathered slate-and-jade domed shell, pale gold eyes, a blunt gentle head and thick scaled flippers. Harmless weed and small shells gather in old grooves. It is unmistakably an animal, without a house, city, human face or clothing on its back.',public='Mauruun rests among Stillback’s rocks with such patience that birds land nearby without alarm. It grazes and watches ordinary visitors without seeking a fight. Old line caught between shell plates gives careful people a reason to help, provided they attend to the creature’s responses.',gear='Its great shell and powerful flippers are natural defenses.',want='Rest undisturbed, feed and preserve its protected nesting shelf.',secret='A loop of old fishing line pulls against a tender shell seam. Removing it carefully would relieve an irritation that onlookers cannot identify from far away.',pressure='Pain, persistent harassment, shell damage or interference with the nesting shelf. A quiet visitor is not a target.',ties='',core='Patient and nonhostile, with animal boundaries that deserve actual attention.',speech='No human language; low breaths, head movement and withdrawing or extending a flipper are readable responses.',habit='Watches a boat for a long time before deciding whether it matters.',stress='Withdraws or warns first when possible; an attack can bring a forceful defensive response.',abilities=['Island Shell: Uses a massive shell and stable body position rather than pursuing ordinary people for sport.','Patient Beast: Can learn that a particular careful approach is harmless without becoming a tame mount or a summoned companion.','Fighting Style: Passive unless provoked. Strong shoves, a sweeping flipper and a brief grounded surge defend its space; peaceful care, collection of naturally shed material and leaving it alone are valid outcomes.']),
dict(name='Ghorvath',gender='male',age='Unknown; fully grown',species='Great kraken mana beast',level=55,location='Splinterwake Wreck',area='Deepwater Edge',primary='Water',extra=['Void','Sound'],special=True,
 appearance='A colossal deep-sea cephalopod with a broad indigo mantle, two cold turquoise eyes and eight distinct muscular arms lined with pale suckers. Purple bioluminescent lines flicker along wet skin. It has no humanoid torso, hands, legs or clothing; some arms may be naturally hidden beneath water.',public='Ghorvath is the great predator associated with vanished fishing gear and broad suckered scars on eastern wreckage. It moves between a limited set of deep approaches and is not present at every disturbed wave. Sailors watch the water and retreat when a broad unnatural swell begins to gather.',gear='Its eight arms, suckers, beak and ink are natural equipment.',want='Feed and defend the deep channels it uses.',secret='Changes in water pressure and prolonged heavy disturbance attract it more readily than an ordinary passing skiff. A patient survey can distinguish its signs from smaller sea life.',pressure='Actual proximity, sustained disturbance and injury. It does not acquire knowledge of a distant player’s inventory.',ties='',core='A territorial deepwater predator, patient before a sudden committed strike.',speech='No human speech; surface disturbances and bodily movement convey its presence.',habit='An arm tests a familiar obstruction before the mantle rises.',stress='Grips, pulls and obstructs an escape within its actual reach; its first approach gives a perceptible disturbance rather than an unavoidable offscreen kill.',abilities=['Eight-Armed Grip: Uses distinct arms for holds and leverage, with an actual point of attachment and room for rescue, cutting free or retreat.','Deep Surge: Gathers water around its body into a forceful local current, destabilizing nearby hulls and obstructing a close escape.','Fighting Style: Tests a hold with one arm before committing its weight, using wreckage and deep water for leverage. Its reach is immense but still bodily, leaving room to cut free or rescue someone caught.'])
]

def add(w,draws):
    names=[]
    for p in PEOPLE+CREATURES:
        name=p['name'];assert name not in w['npcs'],name
        location=p['location'];assert location in w['locations'],location
        areas=w['locations'][location]['areas'];area=location+' - '+p['area'] if p.get('area') else next(iter(areas))
        assert area in areas,(name,area)
        affinities=draws[name]['affinities']
        basic=p['public']+'\n\n'+p['appearance']+'\n\nEquipment: '+p['gear']+'\n\n'+f"- **Gender:** {p['gender'].capitalize()}\n- **Age:** {p['age']}\n- **Species:** {p['species']}\n- **Role in faction:** {p.get('role','Independent mana beast')}\n- **Magic affinity:** "+', '.join(affinities)
        hidden='\n\n'.join([f'**Private motive:** {p["want"]}',f'**What they conceal:** {p["secret"]}','**Concealment and knowledge:** Other people know only what they actually observe, hear or establish. A private motive is not an automatic public introduction.',f'**Pressure point:** {p["pressure"]}']+([f'**Relationships:** {p["ties"]}'] if p['ties'] else []))
        kind='Mana Beast' if p in CREATURES else 'Adventurer' if p.get('faction')=="Adventurer's Guild" or p.get('special') else 'Healer' if p['name']=='Lucette Bellanger' else 'Researcher' if p['name']=='Mina Takanashi' else 'Merchant' if p['name']=='Kanna Enozaki' else 'Artisan' if p['name'] in ['Yorina Tsugawa','Fuyuka Kusanagi','Daisaku Minobe'] else 'Resident'
        npc={'name':name,'properName':name,'type':kind,'currentLocation':location,'currentArea':area,'gender':p['gender'],'tier':'boss' if name in ['Nerathyl','Ghorvath'] else 'elite' if name=='Mauruun' else 'average','detailType':'detailed','level':p['level'],'healthMultiplier':1.15 if name=='Ghorvath' else 1,'successBonus':0,'damageModifier':0,'damageReductionModifier':0,'initialKnown':False,'initialRelationship':-80 if name=='Ghorvath' else -30 if name=='Nerathyl' else 0,'visualDescription':p['appearance'],'basicInfo':basic,'hiddenInfo':hidden,'personality':['Core: '+p['core'],'Speaking Style: '+p['speech'],'Routine or Quirk: '+p['habit'],'Under Pressure: '+p['stress']],'abilities':p['abilities'],'portraitUrl':''}
        if p.get('faction'):npc['faction']=p['faction']
        npc['voiceTag']='female harsh commanding' if name=='Reina Kazehara' else 'female calm controlled' if p['gender']=='female' else 'male deep hearty commanding' if name=='Daigo Umetsu' else 'male young charismatic'
        if p in CREATURES:npc.pop('voiceTag',None)
        w['npcs'][name]=npc;names.append(name)
    return names
